// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P2265270540" "Miss Liberty"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P1410473990" "Stefan Richter"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P2808151008" "Lord Recluse"
// Script Variable NPC_DIALOG_NAME :
"P3904070179" "Monica Richter"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P1160780142" "Don't you understand? This is the future! There is no stopping this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1444171721" "I've worked too hard, {HeroName}, to have my life's goal stopped by someone like you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3268985929" "Statesman couldn't stop me, what makes you think that YOU stand any chance?!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1275504567" "I don't have time for this! When we meet again, {HeroName}, I will be a god, and you will be destroyed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Wade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2616304286" "Darrin Wade escaped!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2550004191" "Aspect of Ruladak"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4035132623" "None"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P821288662" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Witness just a mere fraction of Rularuu's power, {HeroName}! I give you an aspect of Ruladak the Ravager!<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Luckily for you, I have not reached the point where I can summon the full force of Ruladak."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P273009584" "<t=6 caption x= 0.5 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>I was hoping we wouldn't come to this, {HeroName}! It's terribly cliché for people to betray each other in the Isles!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1365036607" "<t=6 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Just understand, I have a plan to deal with Rularuu entering this world. I'm not about to let him wipe out all of existence. Of course, I'll make an exception for you."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1795379201" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Well, it looks like you're doing quite well against the aspect of Ruladak! I shouldn't have been surprised, but then again, you were never a factor in all of this."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2136235125" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>Hrmph. It doesn't matter. There are cogs that have been turning for years now, {HeroName}. <t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkGray>You're now officially in my plans now, {HeroName}, as someone who needs to be stopped at all costs. We'll be seeing each other again soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2575576233" "Statesman is dead, along with your partnership with Darrin Wade."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3689770185" "Yo! So, how did it go?<br><br>Statesman's... -what-?! Did YOU do it?<br><br>Wade? Man... that's a scoop if I ever heard one. So, this guy is looking to take over the entire world, huh? That's pretty crazy. Not the first guy that's tried it, of course, but he definitely has a creative idea behind it.<br><br>Things are gonna get pretty crazy soon, {HeroName}. Every mook who even has some sort of super power is gonna be donning their gear to paint Paragon red. Now, me, I'm gonna be staying right here.<br><br>I don't know what you're gonna do, though. I mean, you're powerful enough that this whole shindig of world destruction is right up your alley, right? Now, I figure you ain't gonna swoop in and play hero to all this, which makes me wonder, what exactly <i>are</i> you gonna do about this?<br><br>I'll let you figure that one out, but hey, from what you said, it sounds like this Darrin Wade guy is pretty furious at you. It's gonna be a showdown of epic proportions, I figure. I just hope I ain't around to watch it go down!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1528378902" "I heard Statesman's dead, and that {HeroName} was there for it!"

